  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The land is raining backward—every drop falling up into the sky. I’ve never seen this much water pulled in the past",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 880
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "King Reynolds—the man I once called my uncle—is dead",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3699
        }
      ],
      "words": 9
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“We always knew this was a possibility,” he says, speaking to his son",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5366
        }
      ],
      "words": 13
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It’s time you come to Dranderon. I won’t let them keep my Little Fire",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7078
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She deals in Stone Sickness—it’s common in Cadmar,” Draven says",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9888
        }
      ],
      "words": 10
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I do. I love her more than everything in existence",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12671
        }
      ],
      "words": 10
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Her mother left the Death Benefit to you, didn’t she?” Father states, though it sounds like more than a question—returni",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13959
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mere inches away, her markings—mirroring my own—were visible underneath the blood, and I knew",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15160
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Love her,” both men say at the same time",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16325
        }
      ],
      "words": 9
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She was saying it to me, too,” Father says, “because she didn’t know who Lavina’s father was",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16582
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    }
  ],
